**/bin/
**/obj/
# `dotnet ef` can leave a literal `bin\Debug` directory on Linux; MSBuild's glob walker fails on
# a path containing a backslash (MSB3552), so keep it out of the build context.
**/*\\*
**/TestResults/
**/node_modules/
web/dist/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
.git/
.github/
docs/
coveragereport/
*.md
.env
